// SegmentTree[T]: range queries over an array.
//
// A tree over an array where each node summarizes a range (its sum, minimum, maximum, ...), so a
// query over any range and an update to any element both take O(log n). More general than a
// Fenwick tree. Useful for range minimum/maximum queries and interval statistics.
